  "body": "Direct-PR: docs steward fix of a stale prose line found by Fable's review of #1030 (AGENTS.md §8)\nClaim: cloud/orch\nAuthor model: Opus 5.5 (cloud/orch)\nReviewer model: pending (Fable)\n\n**Problem.** `docs/migration/GAP-LEGACY-VS-SWIFT.md` (line 322, under the H.1 tally) lists « the (b) rows the merged code already ships: 009, 020, 022, 051, 060, 092, 163, 212, 214 (008 joins once #540 merges) ». Several entries are out of date:\n- 020, 022 and 214 are `a` and 212 is `a·master`, both in their rows and in the tally.\n- #540 has merged, so 008 ships too.\n\n**Change.** One line: « 008, 009, 051, 060, 092, 163 (020, 022, 212 and 214 now follow legacy, so they are `a` or `a·master`) ». `fold.py --check`: ok.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CGTbJ8LjeZ6VYEWrtJ)_",
